@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
title UC17 — Normal
actor "Pengguna" as User
boundary ":HalamanPercakapan" as UI
control ":PercakapanController" as PC
control ":Otorisasi" as Oto
entity ":SesiLogin" as Sesi
entity ":Percakapan" as Perc
control ":Kriptografi" as Kr
entity ":Pesan" as Pesan
control ":NotifikasiController" as NC
entity ":Notifikasi" as Notif
participant ":PushNotifikasiAdapter" as Push
boundary ":PanelNotifikasi\n(penerima)" as Panel
User -> UI: kirimPesan(isi)
UI -> UI: validasiInputKosong(isi)
UI -> PC: kirimPesan(token, idPercakapan, isi)
PC -> Oto: verifikasiToken(token)
Oto -> Sesi: cariSesiAktif(token)
Sesi --> Oto: sesiLogin
Oto --> PC: sesiLogin
PC -> Sesi: getIdAkun()
Sesi --> PC: idPengirim
PC -> Perc: cariById(idPercakapan)
Perc --> PC: percakapan
PC -> PC: verifikasiPeserta(idPengirim, percakapan)
PC -> Perc: cekPeserta(idPengirim)
Perc --> PC: true
note right of PC: Pihak selain kedua peserta ditolak (KF35)
PC -> PC: enkripsiPesan(isi)
PC -> Kr: enkripsi(isi)
Kr --> PC: isiPesanTerenkripsi
PC -> Perc: addPesan(idPengirim, isiPesanTerenkripsi)
Perc -> Pesan: simpanPesan(idPercakapan, idPengirim, isiPesanTerenkripsi)
Pesan --> Perc: pesan
Perc --> PC: pesan
PC -> Perc: perbaruiWaktuTerakhir(waktuKirim)
PC --> UI: {isi, waktuKirim}
UI -> UI: tampilkanUrutanPesan(daftarPesan)
UI -> UI: gulirKePesanTerakhir()
PC -> NC: kirimNotifikasi(idPenerima, "Pesan Baru", isi)
NC -> Notif: simpan(idPenerima, "Pesan Baru", isi, waktuKirim, false)
Notif --> NC: true
NC -> Notif: hitungBelumDibaca(idPenerima)
Notif --> NC: jumlahBelumDibaca
NC -> NC: kirimPushNotifikasi(idPenerima, isi)
NC -> Push: kirimPush(idPenerima, "Pesan baru", isi)
Push --> NC: true
note over Push, Panel: Service Worker pada peramban penerima menampilkan notifikasi,\ntermasuk saat ITBELI sedang tidak dibuka (KF34)
Panel -> Panel: tampilkanPenandaBelumDibaca(jumlahBelumDibaca)
@enduml
